tweets.text:
The leaders also discussed the worsening humanitarian situation in Gaza.

Civilians caught in the middle urgently need food, electricity, water, medicine, and shelter.

@POTUS asked the Israeli Cabinet to allow the delivery of humanitarian assistance, and they agreed.

